  "body_html": "\n\n\t<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/Jam-PB-5e9656f536c5b-300x169.png\" alt=\"Atlanta photo booth rental by JAMMIN' DJs for weddings and events\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" /></p>\n<h2>Atlanta Photo Booth Rental for Weddings &amp; Events</h2>\n<p>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs offers Atlanta photo booth rental options for weddings, Bar and Bat Mitzvahs, school dances, corporate events, birthday parties, quinceañeras, holiday parties, and private celebrations. Our photo booth experiences give guests a fun way to capture memories. They also add another layer of entertainment to your event.</p>\n<p>Whether you want a social photo booth, roaming photo booth, 360 photo booth, onsite printing, custom branding, or instant digital sharing, our team can help you choose the right booth experience.</p>\n<h3>LED Social Photo Booth</h3>\n<p>Our LED Social Booth is a state-of-the-art photo booth that is fun, compact, and visually stunning. In addition, it offers features such as GIF creation, Boomerang-style clips, digital props, digital backgrounds, QR code delivery, text sharing, email sharing, and social media sharing when Wi-Fi is available.</p>\n<p>Because every event is different, we can customize the home screen and photo designs with your monogram, logo, event name, or custom branding. Guests can receive their photos by QR code, text, email, or social media. After the event, the host can access an online gallery with the photos taken in the booth.</p>\n<h3>Roaming Photo Booth Option</h3>\n<p>You can also select our roaming photo booth option. With this setup, the booth head can be removed by our photo booth attendant. Then, the attendant can move around the room and take photo booth pictures at tables, on the dance floor, or during key moments.</p>\n<p>This option works well for cocktail hours, corporate events, mitzvahs, receptions, and parties where guests are spread throughout the venue.</p>\n<h3>Backdrops, Props &amp; Onsite Printing</h3>\n<p>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs social photo booth has a small footprint, so it works well for events of all sizes. We offer props for use, or you may provide your own props to match your event theme.</p>\n<p>The booth can use a physical backdrop, digital backdrop, green screen, or white backdrop. Digital backdrops are complimentary. However, luxury backdrops and green screen options may be available as premium add-ons.</p>\n<p>We also offer onsite printing as an add-on. Custom photo strips can include your logo, monogram, event branding, background, or custom design. As a result, guests can take home a printed memory while the host can still receive digital copies after the event.</p>\n<p>Our photo booth is stylish, visually appealing, and designed with a minimal footprint. Also, we can customize the LED lighting color to better match your event style.</p>\n<h3>360 Photo Booth Rental</h3>\n<p>Our new <strong>360 Photo Booth</strong> is absolutely amazing. You can choose an open-air setup, red carpet setup, or inflatable enclosure for your guests.</p>\n<p>Once guests step into the booth, the 360 booth can support small groups and produce a video-style photo booth experience they will love. Afterward, guests can scan a QR code on the screen, receive a text message, or use social media delivery options for instant sharing.</p>\n<p>The host will also have access to the complete gallery of videos taken in the booth. In addition, the booth can be customized with your logo or monogram on the videos, welcome screen, and inflatable enclosure when available.</p>\n<p>We use quality photo booth technology to help create high-quality videos and photos for you and your guests. Call, text, or email us today for more information or to book your event.</p>\n<h3><strong>Check Out Our New 360 Degree Photo Booth</strong></h3>\n\n\t\t<style>\n\t\t\t#gallery-14 {\n\t\t\t\tmargin: auto;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-14 .gallery-item {\n\t\t\t\tfloat: left;\n\t\t\t\tmargin-top: 10px;\n\t\t\t\ttext-align: center;\n\t\t\t\twidth: 25%;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-14 img {\n\t\t\t\tborder: 2px solid #cfcfcf;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-14 .gallery-caption {\n\t\t\t\tmargin-left: 0;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t/* see gallery_shortcode() in wp-includes/media.php */\n\t\t</style>\n\t\t<div id='gallery-14' class='gallery galleryid-4717 gallery-columns-4 gallery-size-thumbnail'><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.jammindjs.net/atlanta-photo-booth-rental/attachment/img_5955/'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/IMG_5955-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"A group of people are standing in a room with lights, enjoying a Georgia corporate DJ service.\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.jammindjs.net/atlanta-photo-booth-rental/attachment/img_5998/'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/IMG_5998-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"A circular table with blue lights and a Georgia corporate DJ service.\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.jammindjs.net/atlanta-photo-booth-rental/attachment/img_5958/'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/IMG_5958-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"A room with a blue light in the middle of it, perfect for a Georgia wedding DJ.\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.jammindjs.net/atlanta-photo-booth-rental/attachment/img_5999/'><img loading=\"lazy\"