et/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/2-300x300.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"A large tent with tables and chairs in it, and a Georgia corporate DJ setup.\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/1.jpeg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/1-300x300.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"A room adorned for a Georgia wedding, with several colorful lights and a table, awaiting the touch of a DJ service.\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><br style=\"clear: both\" /><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/IMG_5993-scaled.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/IMG_5993-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"A display with a rainbow-colored light on it, perfect for Georgia corporate DJ events.\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/290192982_5217075084996988_7961573504110136542_n.jpeg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/290192982_5217075084996988_7961573504110136542_n-300x300.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"A group of people are standing in front of a large lighted stand operated by a Georgia corporate DJ.\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/IMG_5935-scaled.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/IMG_5935-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"A light stand with a rainbow colored light on it, perfect for Georgia wedding DJ services.\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon portrait'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/IMG_5969-scaled.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/IMG_5969-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"McDonald&#039;s Georgia corporate DJ.\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><br style=\"clear: both\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\n<h3><strong>Roaming Photo Booth</strong></h3>\n\n\t\t<style>\n\t\t\t#gallery-16 {\n\t\t\t\tmargin: auto;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-16 .gallery-item {\n\t\t\t\tfloat: left;\n\t\t\t\tmargin-top: 10px;\n\t\t\t\ttext-align: center;\n\t\t\t\twidth: 25%;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-16 img {\n\t\t\t\tborder: 2px solid #cfcfcf;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t#gallery-16 .gallery-caption {\n\t\t\t\tmargin-left: 0;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t/* see gallery_shortcode() in wp-includes/media.php */\n\t\t</style>\n\t\t<div id='gallery-16' class='gallery galleryid-4717 gallery-columns-4 gallery-size-thumbnail'><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.jammindjs.net/atlanta-photo-booth-rental/attachment/1-5/'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/1-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/1-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/1-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/1-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/1.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.jammindjs.net/atlanta-photo-booth-rental/attachment/image_16891905-2/'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/image_16891905-1-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.jammindjs.net/atlanta-photo-booth-rental/attachment/2-4/'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/2-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Atlanta Photo Booth host for events\" srcset=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/2-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/2-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/2-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/2.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><dl class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<dt class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https://www.jammindjs.net/atlanta-photo-booth-rental/attachment/image_16900865-2/'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.jammindjs.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/image_16900865-1-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" /></a>\n\t\t\t</dt></dl><br style=\"clear: both\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\n<h2>What Is Included With Our Photo Booth Rentals?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Photo Booth Options</strong> &#8211; You have two main options: our Social Booth or our 360 Video/Photo Booth. Our social booth is a high-tech, low-footprint photo booth option. Meanwhile, our 360 video booth provides a high-energy video experience that helps guests capture the moment in a fun and shareable way.</li>\n<li><strong>Open-Air, Green Screen, or Backdrop Options</strong> &#8211; Our Social Booth can be used open air or with a green screen, white backdrop, digital backdrop, luxury backdrop, or custom backdrop option when available.</li>\n<li><strong>Roaming Photo Booth Option</strong> &#8211; Our Social Booth can also be used as a roaming photo booth add-on. This is a great option when guests are spread throughout the room.</li>\n<li><strong>Premium Props</strong> &#8211; We love props. Therefore, our photo booth packages can include fun traditional items such as mustaches on sticks, glasses, signs, hats, and themed pieces. You are also welcome to provide props that best represent your party.</li>\n<li><strong>Onsite Printing</strong> &#8211; We can print onsite as an add-on. Custom strips can include a logo, monogram, background, or custom event design. In addition, printed strips make a great keepsake for guests or guest books.</li>\n<li><strong>Digital Copies</strong> &#8211; The host can receive digital copies of the images taken at the event. Delivery options may include a website download after the event or upgraded delivery options when available.</li>\n<li><strong>Photo Booth Staff</strong> &#8211; Staff is included to operate the photo booth and assist guests throughout the event.</li>\n<li><strong>Fun for Any Event</strong> &#8211; Our Atlanta photo booth rental options are a great fit for weddings, mitzvahs, school dances, corporate events, birthday parties, quinceañeras, holiday parties, and private celebrations.</li>\n<li><strong>Instant Sharing</strong> &#8211; When Wi-Fi is available, guests can post their pictures on social media in real time while still at the event.</li>\n<li><strong>Email Delivery</strong> &#8211; Guests can instantly request an email of their photo strips when this feature is enabled.</li>\n<li><strong>Custom Welcome Screen and Strips</strong> &#8211; Add the client name, event name, monogram, logo, or custom design to the main welcome screen and photo strips.</li>\n<li><strong>Backdrop Choices</strong> &#8211; We have options for green screen, white backdrop, digital backdrop, luxury backdrop, and custom backgrounds when available.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em><strong>*Wi-Fi must be available at the venue for social media, email, text, or instant sharing functionality.</strong></em></p>\n<p><em><strong>**Roaming photo booth options may be available as an add-on.</strong></em></p>\n<p><em><strong>***Printing may be available as an add-on.</strong></em></p>\n<p><em><strong>****Green screen, luxury backdrops, and custom backgrounds may be available as premium add-ons.</strong></em></p>\n<p><em><strong>Be sure to check out our demo video:</strong></em> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/qXJ8-sRLgSk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Watch the JAMMIN&#8217; DJs photo booth demo video on YouTube</a></p>\n<h2>Atlanta Photo Booth Office</h2>\n\n  <strong>JAMMIN&#8217; Photo Booth</strong><br />\n  1000 Parkwood Circle SE, Suite 900<br />\n  Atlanta, GA 30339\n\n\n  Office: <a href=\"tel:+14049904439\">(404) 990-4439</a><br />\n  Toll Free: <a href=\"tel:+18004451204\">(800) 445-1204</a>\n\t<p>Instagram tag: <strong><a href=\"http://outbound-email.shootproof.com/ls/click?upn=keJfJ3PLpKIeFy0UpVH1ePN4gsb-2FFv5OumWaw6umlznhRyPCLi5U4WjFC9047iX4aIcbsTOegk-2FvIDr-2FGtzDjw-3D-3DGlsI_0ujZrnHxNsgxW-2Fk2gJr-2Fkux5nob-2Bk2T2c-2Bbbn87LpJs1yGwvziq63RAv-2F8-2B8RaOC3i-2FueAPcE1S2GH7-2FVOids33EeobZ2-2BxstVS-2BgPv0qhH0LTu25XnxQYdy4z0VMfyVEmcbHcPHjYT30ueWzDCxe-2FHd9ufhFgWjGe8jT0ilJfMJiwb05YAbgnMPGX6xNUTNtnptMMQ2kISPB7WwyOL7P8CcltNjNTP3647tcfE1IcR9KAuIgwqZ5uDLUey6LTZnnelDw24rUuI558Sp6vYvVW5phSoaFcd1jMf1V952b8GYdgFJNKCfZ9vyXrEsrDqb-2BxcZb5-2BrsduKrljjjEpVDyH8ydltPmaY7vfNhdWObOhUowzmZYaR9EcnONMmRlux3zRRaqKbyYZd1SMGj6bJ88yvHehc-2BiZpJnLTtqk9QVDBEgarFuJ-2B46qGaswtKTeGheAFtUoib81obJ-2BjvwqTKGRmlehG6-2FZTGtCHVFgQguYR-2F4V8VdMFoNlNuVC5rWAGNzEO3tXneump8l9ApKijdvC0jiFs2kqhcB0MDgTuGPpLv6sENcYZQOpYombdQrUPeb6odISx